<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<section xml:id="sec-code" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude">
  <title>Code Listings</title>
  <p>A numbered code listing wraps a <c>program</c> in a <c>listing</c>. <xref ref="listing-is-prime" /> tests whether a number is prime.</p>
  <listing xml:id="listing-is-prime">
    <caption>A primality test in Python</caption>
    <program language="python">
      <code>
def is_prime(n):
    if n &lt; 2:
        return False
    for d in range(2, int(n ** 0.5) + 1):
        if n % d == 0:
            return False
    return True

print([p for p in range(2, 20) if is_prime(p)])
      </code>
    </program>
  </listing>
  <p>Running it prints the primes below 20:</p>
  <console>
    <input>python is_prime.py</input>
    <output>[2, 3, 5, 7, 11, 13, 17, 19]</output>
  </console>
</section>